{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["CARDFIGHT!! VANGUARD Divinez DELUXE Arc","After the conclusion of the Destined Showdown, Akina and the other Vanguard fighters are enjoying their peaceful days when a missive arrives. It is an invitation to \"DELUXE\", the tournament to determine the strongest Vanguard fighter!\n\n\n\nThe third iteration of the tournament is packed with must-see matchups produced by AI Gui, featuring the miraculous return of Michiru Hazama, and the legendary strongest fighter of Mythisch, Kagetsu Yakumo.\n\n\n\nAnd in the midst of this tournament, Akina is faced with a question posed to him by Nao's mentor Kagetsu: \"What is your reason for playing Vanguard?\"\n\n\n\nWhat is the meaning behind this question? And how will Akina respond?\n\n\n\nThe quest for the pinnacle of DELUXE begins now!\n\n\n\n(Source: Official Site)"],"ja":["カードファイト!! ヴァンガード Divinez デラックス編",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":54143,"relation":"prequel"},{"id":54145,"relation":"sequel"}],"id":"mal-54144","ids":{"shikimori":54144,"mal":54144,"anilist":182920,"kodik":"serial-64639"},"kodikIds":["serial-64639"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-64639":"2025-04-20T07:17:00Z"},"title":"Карточные бои Авангарда: Святая Зет — Делюкс","originalTitle":"Cardfight!! Vanguard: Divinez Deluxe Hen","alt":"Карточные бои Авангарда: Святая Зет — Делюкс / Cardfight!! Vanguard: Divinez Deluxe-hen CARDFIGHT!! VANGUARD Divinez DELUXE Arc カードファイト!! ヴァンガード Divinez デラックス編","description":"Турнир по определению сильнейшего карточного бойца Vanguard \"Deluxe\", Акина Мёдо и другие бойцы получили приглашение на турнир. На этот раз в нем также примут участие многие легендарные бойцы!","year":2025,"type":"TV","genres":["Экшен","стратегические игры"],"rating":7.01,"popularity":1313,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[54143,54145],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/54144/e5b112863c3aa655108b3d25b2e3d4cb.jpeg","width":700,"height":995},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shik